@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = PEGAR_EL_TOKEN_DEL_LOGIN

### Listado y detalle -> publicos
GET {{baseUrl}}/entries

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/entries/1

### Crear -> solo el dueno DEL EVENTO (la entrada hereda el dueno)
POST {{baseUrl}}/entries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entry_name": "General", "entry_description": "Campo",
  "unit_price": 5000.50, "stock": 300,
  "date_time_start": "2027-09-01T22:00:00.000Z",
  "date_time_end": "2027-09-02T02:00:00.000Z",
  "id_event": 1
}

### La suma de stocks supera el total del evento -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/entries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entry_name": "Imposible", "unit_price": 100, "stock": 999999,
  "date_time_start": "2027-09-01T22:00:00.000Z",
  "date_time_end": "2027-09-02T02:00:00.000Z",
  "id_event": 1
}

### B6 - La entrada empieza antes que el evento -> 400
# Las fechas de una entrada son su HORARIO DE ACCESO dentro del evento.
POST {{baseUrl}}/entries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entry_name": "Temprana", "unit_price": 100, "stock": 1,
  "date_time_start": "2027-09-01T18:00:00.000Z",
  "date_time_end": "2027-09-02T02:00:00.000Z",
  "id_event": 1
}

### Bajar el stock por debajo de lo ya vendido -> 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/entries/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stock": 1 }

### Eliminar una entrada con ventas -> 400
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/entries/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
